    "lists": {
      "ordered": [
        {
          "text": "**In the same note** — as a `meta-bind-button` code block with matching `id`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 92,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Globally** — in Meta Bind Settings → Button Templates",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 96,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Decide the action type** — What should the button do? (open, create, update, command)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 235,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Choose a unique ID** — Use kebab-case, descriptive: `new-srl-session`, `open-calibration-log`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 239,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Write the button definition** — Place the `meta-bind-button` code block in your note:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 243,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Add inline reference** (optional) — If you want the button rendered inline elsewhere in the same note:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 250,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Test** — Switch to Reading Mode or Live Preview and click the button",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 252,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open **Settings → Meta Bind → Button Templates**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 258,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add a new template with your button configuration",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 261,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Reference it from any note using `BUTTON[template-id]`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 262,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure the **template file exists** at the specified path",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 264,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure the **output folder exists** in your vault",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 266,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify the template path matches your Templater template folder setting",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 266,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Test by clicking the button — Templater prompts should appear",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 271,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Button IDs** — Use kebab-case: `new-srl-session`, `open-calibration-log`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 314,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Template paths** — Always start from vault root: `99-system/01-quickadd/02-templates/`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 315,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Output folders** — Use full vault-relative paths: `999-report-orginizing/srl-practice/srl-sessions/`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 317,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Inline references** — Place `BUTTON[id]` references in a Quick Actions section at the top of notes",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 319,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Button definitions** — Place `meta-bind-button` code blocks below the inline references in the same note",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 321,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**INPUT fields** — Use inside templates that Templater creates; the INPUT renders in the created note",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 323,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        }
      ],
