        },
        {
          "text": "**Switch to Reading Mode or Live Preview** — buttons don't render in Source mode",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 279,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify Meta Bind plugin is **enabled** in Community Plugins settings",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 281,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Check for YAML syntax errors in the button code block",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 285,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify the button definition with that `id` exists in the **same note** or in **global Button Templates**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 287,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Check the `id` matches exactly (case-sensitive)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 290,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure the button code block uses the correct language identifier: `meta-bind-button`",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 291,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify `templateFile` path is correct (vault-relative, forward slashes, includes `.md`)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 295,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify `folderPath` exists in the vault",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 297,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure Templater plugin is installed and enabled",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 298,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Check Templater's template folder setting includes the template location",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 298,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify the syntax: `INPUT[type(options):property]` — wrapped in backticks",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 305,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "The frontmatter property will be created automatically if it doesn't exist",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 306,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Check Meta Bind's `excludedFolders` setting doesn't include your note's folder",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 307,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Check the `syncInterval` in Meta Bind settings (default 200ms is fine)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 310,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure the note isn't in an excluded folder",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 311,
          "source": "Meta-Bind-Button-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify the frontmatter property name matches exactly",
          "indent_level": 0,
